{"version":1,"title":"ArcheAxis Knowledge OS 最终成熟方案：历史权威重构、Absorb-First 能力融合与 Local Green 收敛","backing_conversation_id":"6aaeaf9a-0fe8-83ea-9e35-9feb040e76c9","widget_session_id":"aa10b64d-c75e-444e-8fac-097d00469ff6","widget_state":{"status":"completed","is_static_preview":true,"report_message":{"id":"193805e2-08d9-4b3f-b65f-d18c8f8f3dc8","author":{"role":"assistant","name":null,"metadata":{}},"create_time":1789833263.338202,"update_time":null,"content":{"content_type":"text","parts":["# ArcheAxis Knowledge OS 最终成熟方案：历史权威重构、Absorb-First 能力融合与 Local Green 收敛\n\n## 执行摘要\n\n本报告把 ArcheAxis 从 2026 年 7 月至 9 月的历史规划、R5 实施与审计、9 月 14/15 日首次使用复审、9 月 18 日状态整理、9 月 19 日独立审计、本次对话中的 Owner 新裁决，以及当前仓库重新出现的 R6 收敛工作，统一成一条新的权威路线。\n\n本轮 GitHub 读取显示，仓库默认主线已经继续前进，当前读取到的 HEAD 为 **`0e934f33ee9a5f6082c04abda454c67df1055097`**，因此此前以 `d1375b9...` 为 HEAD 的 9 月 19 日审计只能作为历史基线，不能再直接当“当前状态”。[当前 HEAD](https://github.com/DTALEX66/ArcheAxis-Knowledge-OS/commit/0e934f33ee9a5f6082c04abda454c67df1055097)\n\n最终建议不是继续在 R5 上追加补丁，而是把项目正式收敛到：\n\n> **R6 = Local Green Convergence + Capability Absorption + Human/Machine Learning + Domain Learning Packs**\n\n并确立以下不可再摇摆的顶层原则：\n\n**第一，GitHub `main` 不再承担产品版本推进语义。** 历史 `v0.6.14`、Tag、Release、Release Evidence 保留作为不可改写的历史事实；`main` 是持续开发线。必要的包版本、协议版本、Schema 版本仍保留，但它们不是新的产品发布版本。\n\n**第二，发布全面冻结。** 当前所有修复、功能吸收、迁移、UI、课程、模型和插件工作，最终只生成 **Local Green Candidate**；通过本机完整资格验证后，可以替换 `D:\\All projects\\ArcheAxis.Knowledge.Green-x64` 中现有 Green 运行时，但仍不创建 Tag、不创建 GitHub Release、不产生 `v0.6.15/v0.7.0`。只有 Owner 后续明确授权才重新启动 Release 工作。\n\n**第三，ArcheAxis 不再追求“大量自研”。** 采用：\n\n> **Absorb First → Integrate Second → Build Last**\n\n知识解析、OCR、RAG、图谱、Memory、课程生成、互动课件、Notebook、学习路径、Tutor、ASR、Embedding、Reranker 等，只要已有成熟方案，优先吸收。ArcheAxis 自研重点缩到 **Canonical Truth、权限、契约、知识生命周期、人/机学习状态、Domain Pack、插件治理、迁移和 Local Green 生命周期**。\n\n**第四，第三方能力必须插件化，而不是继续堆进核心。** OpenMAIC、H5P、LearningMAP、DeepTutor、RAG-Anything、LightRAG、Graphiti、MemOS 等可以成为 Provider/Renderer/Worker/Sidecar，但任何一个都不得成为第二个 ArcheAxis Canonical Store。\n\n**第五，Evidence 不再是 Knowledge Admission Gate。** `personal_experience`、`personal_note`、`project_observation` 可以没有外部证据而合法成为用户自己的 Accepted Knowledge；机器输出即使有引用，也只能先进入 Candidate。外部证据、置信度、风险、有效时间、来源类型是独立维度。\n\n**第六，学习系统必须从“文档→总结→Quiz”升级为领域化教学系统。** 不同知识领域必须使用不同的 ontology、knowledge components、prerequisites、pedagogy、assessment、renderer 和 model profile，这就是新的 **Domain Learning Pack**。\n\n**第七，本地 Green 才是最终真实性验收环境。** CI 证明代码可构建，不证明用户能用；单元测试不证明 Green 重启后数据还在；模拟 `correct=true` 不证明学习闭环。最终唯一有效的是本机真实：\n\n```text\n资料\n→ 解析\n→ 阅读\n→ 知识\n→ 课程/学习资产\n→ 真人学习\n→ 真实回答\n→ 掌握状态\n→ 机器使用\n→ 失败/修正\n→ Lesson/Skill\n→ 重启\n→ 同一 Workspace 回读\n```\n\n完整目标架构如下：\n\n```mermaid\nflowchart TD\n    U[Human / Owner] --> A[Avalonia Workspace]\n\n    A --> C[Rust Core API / Application]\n    C --> DB[(Canonical SQLite)]\n    C --> K[Knowledge / Source / Learning / Machine State]\n\n    C --> PM[Capability & Plugin Manager]\n\n    PM --> P1[Parsing / OCR / ASR Workers]\n    PM --> P2[Retrieval / Graph Projections]\n    PM --> P3[Course & Artifact Renderers]\n    PM --> P4[Tutor / Adaptive Learning]\n    PM --> P5[Machine Experience Memory]\n    PM --> P6[Local Model Pool]\n\n    P1 -->|Result Contract| C\n    P2 -->|Derived Projection| C\n    P3 -->|Artifact Manifest| C\n    P4 -->|Learning Events| C\n    P5 -->|Lesson / Skill Candidate| C\n    P6 -->|Inference Result| C\n\n    DB --> LG[Local Green]\n    LG --> Q[Local Qualification]\n    Q --> O[LOCAL_GREEN_READY_FOR_OWNER_REVIEW]\n\n    O -. Owner future authorization only .-> R[Future Release]\n```\n\n其中 **虚线的 Release 路径当前关闭**。\n\n## 权威历史、当前基线与差距\n\nArcheAxis 的历史不能简单理解成“旧任务已经过期”。正确做法是把历史分为 **设计来源、实施事实、审计事实和当前权威**。R5 不删除，它是重要工程证据；但 R6 应成为唯一活动计划。\n\n历史演进可以收敛成：\n\n```mermaid\ntimeline\n    title ArcheAxis 权威演进\n    2026-07 : Knowledge OS / Human-AI 双向学习蓝图形成\n    2026-08 : 多轮深化任务包 : Release 与 Green 工程成熟\n    2026-09-01 : Rust Core + Python Worker 边界重新确立\n    2026-09-03 : Avalonia 成为正式 Desktop 方向\n    2026-09-04 : Clean-Sheet vNext : Authority / Supersession 重构\n    2026-09-05 : R1-R3.1 : Reuse First 逐步建立\n    2026-09-13 : R5 成为活动主线 : Rust / Avalonia / FSRS / Migration 实装\n    2026-09-14 : 可用性复审 : Green / Restore / Learning Contract / Environment\n    2026-09-15 : First-Use 全仓审计 : 四个真实用户断点\n    2026-09-18 : 分支 / DSH / 状态整理\n    2026-09-19 : 独立审计 : State / Digest / Ruleset / Architecture 漂移\n    2026-09-19 : Owner 新裁决 : No Release / Local Green / Absorb First / Evidence Relaxation\n    2026-09-19 : R6 : Local Green + Capability Mesh + Domain Learning Packs\n```\n\n当前优先级建议明确为：\n\n```text\nOwner 本次对话裁决\n        ↓\nR6 当前权威任务 / Contract\n        ↓\nCurrent code + tests + GitHub live configuration\n        ↓\nR5 implementation evidence\n        ↓\nR3/R2/旧 TaskPack\n        ↓\nHistorical release / legacy architecture\n```\n\n也就是说，当旧任务写“必须有 evidence 才能进入 knowledge”，而 Owner 当前裁决允许个人经验无外证入库时，**以当前 Owner 裁决为准，并由 R6 把它写成正式仓库 Authority**。\n\n### 历史发现 → 当前结果 → R6 深化\n\n| 历史发现 | 当前是否已修复、已有证据 | 新权威下的深化与任务 |\n|---|---|---|\n| **9/14：执行环境可能不是合法 Git 根** | 已有修复提交 `93faebc`，强化 execution preflight。[commit](https://github.com/DTALEX66/ArcheAxis-Knowledge-OS/commit/93faebc) | **P1 / A02**：所有 Worker/Adapter/Sidecar 统一使用 Capability Resolver；禁止自行猜 PATH、CWD、模型路径。 |\n| **9/14：Restore 只证明 SQLite 能打开，不证明是正确的 ArcheAxis Backup** | `a3ea5f1` 增加 backup identity metadata。[commit](https://github.com/DTALEX66/ArcheAxis-Knowledge-OS/commit/a3ea5f1) | **P0 / A13**：升级为 workspace-id + schema + manifest digest + snapshot identity + semantic readback；Migration 激活前必须 dry-run。 |\n| **9/14：Learning Review Contract 过弱** | `e50e444` 增加版本化 Learning Review Evidence Contract。[commit](https://github.com/DTALEX66/ArcheAxis-Knowledge-OS/commit/e50e444) | **P0 / A08**：扩展为 learning objective、KC、item/version、knowledge/version、response、hints、pedagogy、assessment rubric、mastery delta。 |\n| **9/14：环境/外部资源依靠 PATH 与隐式探测** | `debabd0` 建立只读 Capability Resolver；9/15 又有 `6643208`、`1f76cb6` 强化共享工具路径。[debabd0](https://github.com/DTALEX66/ArcheAxis-Knowledge-OS/commit/debabd0) · [6643208](https://github.com/DTALEX66/ArcheAxis-Knowledge-OS/commit/6643208) | **P0 / A02-A03**：合并为统一 `Capability Profile + Resource ID`；插件只引用资源 ID，不硬编码路径。 |\n| **9/14：Avalonia 有桌面壳，但真人 Review 链不完整** | `32ba061` 接通 desktop review → Core，`258744e` 增加 review provenance。[32ba061](https://github.com/DTALEX66/ArcheAxis-Knowledge-OS/commit/32ba061) | **P0 / A08-A12**：从“提交 Review”升级成 Course → Activity → Answer → Assessment → Mastery → Review 全学习工作区。 |\n| **9/14：Capability Receipt 没有足够真实版本信息** | `d5d8ab0` 记录真实 capability tool version。[commit](https://github.com/DTALEX66/ArcheAxis-Knowledge-OS/commit/d5d8ab0) | **P1 / A03**：Receipt 增加 plugin id/source pin/model/quant/runtime/config/input digest。 |\n| **9/14：正式 Avalonia 架构与旧发布/Tauri 链不一致** | `4903c4d` 曾增加 formal desktop architecture gate。[commit](https://github.com/DTALEX66/ArcheAxis-Knowledge-OS/commit/4903c4d) | **P0 / A01**：不再修“新 Release”；旧 Release 留历史。CI 改为 Local Green qualification，不得创建发布。 |\n| **9/15：Import 可能只生成 Source，而未形成可读内容** | 后续 R5 已增加 import→job→execution，但历史审计证明不能以 API 存在代替真人验证。 | **P0 / A05-A14**：真实 `ceshi` 文件进入 Source 后必须自动 Transform、Anchor、Reader 可见；最终 Golden Journey 做回归。 |\n| **9/15：空库没有第一份 Learning Item** | Review/Queue 已增强，但“谁生成第一次学习资产”是结构性问题。 | **P0 / A08-A10**：由 Domain Pack + Course Planner 从 Accepted Knowledge 生成第一份 LearningArtifact，不允许靠预灌 learning event。 |\n| **9/15：DEV 临时 DB 被误当 Green 持久 Workspace** | 历史测试已识别此问题，但必须保持长期 Gate。 | **P0 / A13-A14**：DEV/TEST/LOCAL-GREEN 三种 workspace profile 完全分开；最终资格只能使用隔离的 Local Green candidate workspace。 |\n| **9/15：Journey 可人为写 `correct=true` 制造假闭环** | `f5847b9` 等提交强化 first-use boundary。[commit](https://github.com/DTALEX66/ArcheAxis-Knowledge-OS/commit/f5847b9) | **P0 / A14**：最终资格禁止 SQL、seed correct、mock model result、synthetic success；必须真人作答和重启回读。 |\n| **9/15：模型资产/工具资产容易复制进入项目** | `19f9ac1`、`7eaad3f`、`6643208`、`1f76cb6` 已向共享资源 Registry 收敛。[19f9ac1](https://github.com/DTALEX66/ArcheAxis-Knowledge-OS/commit/19f9ac1) | **P0 / A02-A11**：所有本地模型继续驻留 `D:\\All projects\\Model library`；插件 manifest 只存 resource ref。 |\n| **9/15：DeepTutor custody 与外部依赖需要明确** | `4b746d1`、`df859df` 分别处理 DeepTutor custody 和外部依赖 inventory。[4b746d1](https://github.com/DTALEX66/ArcheAxis-Knowledge-OS/commit/4b746d1) | **P1 / A03-A08**：不再固定旧 DeepTutor 行为面；重新 pin 1.6.x 能力，按 Sidecar/Adapter 吸收。 |\n| **9/18：历史分支、DSH 结果和当前任务状态混在一起** | 9/18 已有整理，但此前仍存在大量 squash 后远端分支。 | **P1 / A00**：按 merged-by-squash/blob-equivalence/disposition ledger 清分支；不能按 ahead/behind 粗暴删除。 |\n| **9/19：`TASKS.json` 与 `R5-STATE.json` 出现两个 Current Truth** | 这是独立审计发现；当前 R6 应视为新的活动层，但必须彻底消除“双写状态”。 | **P0 / A00**：唯一可写 Task SSOT；状态页、报告、Dashboard 全部生成，不得人工维护第二份 Current。 |\n| **9/19：digest authority 存在死路径/命名漂移** | 历史审计确认问题。 | **P0 / A00**：canonicalization profile 只保留一个真实路径和 profile id；CI 做引用存在性验证。 |\n| **9/19：PROJECT_CONTRACT required checks 与 GitHub live ruleset 不一致** | 当时独立审计读到 live `main` required check 为 `a0-gates`，而 contract 曾声明其他名字。当前 HEAD 后 live 状态未在本轮完整复验。 | **P0 / A00-A01**：只保留一个最终 aggregate gate；仓库 Contract 必须从 live ruleset 反向证明一致。 |\n| **9/19：Green Candidate 不一定进入最终聚合 Gate** | 历史 `green-candidate-vnext` 与 `a0-gates` 存在潜在断口。 | **P0 / A01-A13**：重命名语义为 `local-green-candidate`，纳入 aggregate gate；但 CI Candidate ≠ 本机 Green Qualified。 |\n| **9/19：Release Ledger / README / evidence 出现版本真相漂移** | 历史 `v0.6.14` evidence 有效，但不同文档曾显示不同“current stable”。 | **P0 / A01**：main 不再声明 current product version；历史 Release Index 从 evidence 自动生成。 |\n| **9/19：CURRENT_ARCHITECTURE / SYSTEM_BOUNDARY 仍残留 Python/Tauri 主产品描述** | Avalonia/Rust 已成为正式方向，旧文档存在历史漂移。 | **P0 / A00**：Current 只画 Avalonia→Rust→Worker；Python/Tauri 移为 `LEGACY_ARCHITECTURE`。 |\n| **9/19：16 格式没有任何一个达到原定义的 Complete** | 历史 R5 矩阵是 **0 Complete / 14 Partial / 2 Custody Only**。 | **P1 / A05**：不降低 Complete 定义；利用 RAG-Anything/Docling/PaddleOCR 等减少自研，把核心格式逐个真正闭环。 |\n| **本次 Owner：个人经验经常天然无证据** | 这是新的最高权威，覆盖过去过于严格的 evidence admission。 | **P0 / A04**：`personal_experience/personal_note/project_observation` 可 Accepted；禁止伪造证据，Evidence 改成独立属性。 |\n| **本次 Owner：不能不断发新版本** | 明确新裁决。 | **P0 / A01**：Release Freeze；终态只能 `LOCAL_GREEN_READY_FOR_OWNER_REVIEW`。 |\n| **本次 Owner：成熟能力全部优先吸收** | 将历史 Reuse First 升级。 | **P0 / A03**：建立 Capability Absorption Registry；任何新增算法先做 upstream check。 |\n\n旧 R5 的格式快照必须继续保留，因为它是衡量 R6 是否真正进步的重要基线，而不是“为了新任务包重新把状态写好看”：\n\n| 格式族 | R5 历史状态 | R6 处理方向 |\n|---|---|---|\n| Text / Markdown / CSV / JSON / XML / Code | Partial | 内部基础 Parser + mature parser fallback |\n| HTML | Partial | static DOM + normalized structure |\n| 动态网页 | Partial | provider/connector，不把浏览器运行时写进核心 |\n| PNG/JPG/OCR | Partial | PaddleOCR/Tesseract + VLM fallback |\n| Native PDF | Partial | Docling/RAG-Anything/PyMuPDF 组合 |\n| Scanned PDF | Partial | render → OCR → page anchor 回写 |\n| DOCX | Partial | mature Office parser |\n| PPTX | Partial | slide hierarchy + speaker notes + images |\n| XLSX | Partial | sheet/table/formula/region |\n| Audio | Partial | SenseVoice/faster-whisper |\n| Video | Partial | scene/audio/subtitle multimodal |\n| SRT/VTT/Canvas | Partial | time anchors / graph structure |\n| EPUB/EML/ODT 等 | Partial | provider adapters |\n| ZIP/目录 | Partial | custody + recursive source membership |\n| DOC/PPT/XLS legacy | Custody Only | LibreOffice/conversion provider，原件保留 |\n| PSD/AI/CDR/CAD/3D | Custody Only | 专业 provider/preview，暂不伪称完整语义支持 |\n\n重要的是：**“Complete”应该变难而不是变容易。** Complete 至少意味着原件/来源、Transform、Structure、Anchor、Loss、Engine Version、Quality、Reader/Query、重启回读均成立。\n\n当前 Rust 边界则属于应该继续保留的成功成果：\n\n```text\nAvalonia         ─┐\nPython Worker    ─┼─ X → raw SQLite\nThird-party      ─┘\n\nRust Application\n       ↓\nRust Store / Writer\n       ↓\nCanonical SQLite\n```\n\n这条边界不因吸收更多开源项目而改变。\n\n另一个必须保留的历史事实是：此前公开稳定 Release `v0.6.14` 已经有完整历史资产/evidence。R6 不删除这些材料；**只是取消它对 `main` 当前产品身份的控制**。历史 Release 与 Local Green Development Line 从此分离。\n\n本轮唯一无法完整重新确认的是 **HEAD `0e934f3...` 之后所有远端分支的精确数量、live ruleset 当前实时状态以及每个 R6 文件的最终路径**。此前审计快照曾记录 17 个非 `main` 分支，但不能把该数字冒充 2026-09-19 当前 HEAD 后重新枚举的实时结果；因此 R6 A00 的第一个机器动作必须重新导出 branch/ruleset/workflow snapshot，而不是复用旧数字。\n\n## 最终架构与本地插件化\n\n最终架构应从“核心不断新增 feature module”改变为：\n\n> **Canonical Kernel + Capability Mesh + Domain Learning Packs + Local Green**\n\nArcheAxis Core 必须自己拥有的东西很少，但这些东西必须牢牢掌握：\n\n| 必须由 ArcheAxis 掌握 | 原因 |\n|---|---|\n| Canonical Source / Knowledge | 避免第三方形成第二真相 |\n| Knowledge lifecycle/version/supersession | 决定知识如何变化 |\n| Personal / External / Machine provenance | 解决证据与个人经验问题 |\n| Human learning canonical state | Tutor 可以换，学习历史不能丢 |\n| Machine task/competence measurement | Memory/Agent 可以换，测量事实不能丢 |\n| Authority / permissions | 插件不能自封权威 |\n| Capability contracts | Upstream 可替换 |\n| Domain Pack contract | 学科教学逻辑不绑定某 Tutor |\n| Migration | 只 ArcheAxis 知道自己的历史语义 |\n| Local Green lifecycle | 本地真实运行资格 |\n| Audit receipts | 可证明发生了什么 |\n\n其余能力尽量插件化。\n\n建议正式引入以下插件类型：\n\n```text\nprovider        外部研究/模型/API Provider\nworker          bounded stdio/process worker\nrenderer        LearningArtifact 渲染器\nsidecar         独立本地服务\nprojection      Derived index / graph / memory\ntool            确定性工具\nui-contribution 声明式菜单/面板贡献\n```\n\n**目录结构建议：**\n\n```text\nArcheAxis-Knowledge-OS/\n├─ config/\n│  ├─ capabilities/\n│  ├─ plugins/\n│  └─ domain-packs/\n├─ plugins/\n│  ├─ builtin/\n│  │  ├─ openmaic-adapter/\n│  │  ├─ h5p-renderer/\n│  │  ├─ jupyterlite-renderer/\n│  │  ├─ rag-anything-worker/\n│  │  └─ memos-agent/\n│  └─ sdk/\n├─ crates/\n│  ├─ archeaxis-plugin-contracts/\n│  └─ archeaxis-capability-registry/\n└─ .project-local/\n   ├─ plugin-cache/\n   ├─ green-candidates/\n   ├─ receipts/\n   └─ qualification/\n```\n\n本地 Green 中：\n\n```text\nD:\\All projects\\ArcheAxis.Knowledge.Green-x64\\\n├─ plugins\\\n│  ├─ manifests\\\n│  └─ adapters\\\n```\n\n但 **模型和大型第三方 Runtime 不复制进 `plugins/`**。它们继续通过 Resource ID 解析：\n\n```text\nmodel:qwen-general\n    → D:\\All projects\\Model library\\...\n\ntool:ffmpeg\n    → D:\\All projects\\OS External Configuration\\...\n\ncapability:openmaic\n    → external runtime resolver\n```\n\n推荐的 Plugin Manifest：\n\n```json\n{\n  \"schema\": \"archeaxis.plugin/v1\",\n  \"id\": \"org.archeaxis.openmaic\",\n  \"display_name\": \"OpenMAIC Course Adapter\",\n  \"plugin_version\": \"adapter-dev\",\n  \"type\": \"sidecar\",\n  \"source\": {\n    \"project\": \"THU-MAIC/OpenMAIC\",\n    \"pin\": \"PIN_REQUIRED\",\n    \"license\": \"VERIFY_AT_PIN\"\n  },\n  \"protocol\": {\n    \"name\": \"archeaxis-capability\",\n    \"major\": 1\n  },\n  \"capabilities\": [\n    \"course.plan\",\n    \"artifact.slide.generate\",\n    \"artifact.interactive.generate\"\n  ],\n  \"runtime\": {\n    \"resource_id\": \"runtime:openmaic\",\n    \"launch_mode\": \"supervised\"\n  },\n  \"permissions\": {\n    \"knowledge\": [\"read-scoped\"],\n    \"learning_artifact\": [\"write-candidate\"],\n    \"filesystem\": [\"temporary-scoped\"],\n    \"network\": [\"declared-provider-only\"],\n    \"canonical_database\": []\n  },\n  \"ui\": {\n    \"menu\": [\n      {\n        \"surface\": \"knowledge\",\n        \"label\": \"生成课程\",\n        \"command\": \"course.plan\"\n      }\n    ]\n  },\n  \"healthcheck\": {\n    \"required\": true\n  }\n}\n```\n\n**核心安全规则：**\n\n插件绝不获得 SQLite path。\n\n插件不会因为被安装就获得全部 Knowledge。\n\nCore 发给插件的应该是：\n\n```text\nscoped input\n+ capability token\n+ temporary source handle\n+ explicit command\n```\n\n结果返回：\n\n```text\nResult Contract\n+ provenance\n+ tool/model version\n+ input digest\n+ output digest\n+ loss/warnings\n```\n\n然后由 Rust Core 决定是否写 Canonical DB。\n\n对于能执行任意代码的 `.NET DLL` 插件，**默认不允许第三方运行时动态装入 Avalonia 主进程**。更安全的策略是：\n\n```text\nTrusted built-in UI\n       ↓\nDeclarative UI contribution\n       ↓\nCore command\n       ↓\nIsolated Worker / Sidecar\n```\n\n只有随 ArcheAxis 构建、Hash 固定、经过供应链审计的 in-process 组件才能例外。\n\n推荐的 UI 插件菜单：\n\n```text\nArcheAxis\n├─ 知识\n│  ├─ 创建知识\n│  ├─ 研究\n│  └─ 生成学习内容 ▸\n│       ├─ 生成课程          [OpenMAIC]\n│       ├─ 生成互动练习      [H5P]\n│       ├─ 生成 Notebook     [JupyterLite]\n│       └─ 自适应学习路径    [LearningMAP]\n│\n├─ 学习\n│  ├─ 我的路径\n│  ├─ 今日复习\n│  ├─ 课程\n│  └─ 学习方式 ▸\n│       ├─ Guided Tutor\n│       ├─ Feynman\n│       ├─ Socratic\n│       └─ Project Learning\n│\n└─ 设置\n   └─ 扩展\n      ├─ 已启用\n      ├─ 可用能力\n      ├─ 模型与运行时\n      ├─ 权限\n      └─ 诊断\n```\n\n注册发现流程：\n\n```mermaid\nsequenceDiagram\n    participant UI as Avalonia\n    participant CR as Capability Registry\n    participant RR as Resource Resolver\n    participant Core as Rust Core\n    participant P as Plugin/Worker\n\n    UI->>CR: 查询 course.generate\n    CR->>RR: 解析 plugin/runtime/model resource\n    RR-->>CR: 路径 + 版本 + availability\n    CR->>Core: Capability Profile\n    Core->>P: supervised launch + scoped token\n    P-->>Core: handshake + protocol version\n    Core->>P: scoped input\n    P-->>Core: result + receipt\n    Core->>Core: validate / canonical write\n    Core-->>UI: canonical result\n```\n\n这解决了未来能力快速变化的问题：OpenMAIC 被更好的项目替代时，只替换 Provider；Knowledge Core 不改。\n\n## 能力吸收与供应链\n\nArcheAxis 的“吸收全部成熟能力”不能理解成把所有仓库 vendor 到一起。正确原则是：\n\n> **一个能力一个默认主实现；其他只能是 fallback、benchmark、optional provider 或 donor。**\n\n以下 Registry 是 R6 的初版。外部项目的 **精确 Git commit 必须在真正吸收 PR 中 pin**；这里没有伪造当前 upstream HEAD，未完成精确 pin 的统一标记为 `PIN_REQUIRED`。\n\n### Capability Absorption Registry 初版\n\n| capability_id | 能力 / upstream | License 初判 | Runtime / 本地资源 | 吸收模式 | Authority / Data Boundary | Benchmark | 状态 / Task |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| `course.openmaic` | [THU-MAIC/OpenMAIC](https://github.com/THU-MAIC/OpenMAIC), `PIN_REQUIRED` | MIT 路线，吸收前读 exact LICENSE | 独立 Web/Python/Node 运行面；模型走 Resource Registry | **ADAPTER + SIDECAR** | 只生成 Course/Artifact Candidate；无 DB 权限 | objective coverage、scene validity、offline artifact、人工可编辑性 | **PILOT / A10** |\n| `artifact.h5p` | [H5P](https://github.com/h5p), `PIN_REQUIRED` | H5P 生态按核心/Content Type逐项审计，不假定全生态同一许可 | JS/HTML renderer | **ADAPTER** | LearningArtifact renderer；不拥有学习真相 | package validity、offline render、event mapping | **ABSORB / A10** |\n| `learning.learningmap` | [ai-for-edu/LearningMAP](https://github.com/ai-for-edu/LearningMAP), `PIN_REQUIRED` | Apache-2.0 路线，精确 pin 前复核 | Python/LLM | **ADAPTER + ALGORITHM DONOR** | KC/Pedagogy/diagnosis 供体；mastery 写入必须经 Core | prerequisite accuracy、diagnosis consistency、lesson relevance | **PILOT / A08-A09** |\n| `tutor.deeptutor` | [HKUDS/DeepTutor](https://github.com/HKUDS/DeepTutor), pin 当前 1.6.x 后冻结 | exact LICENSE 在集成 PR 重新确认 | Sidecar + LLM | **SIDECAR + ADAPTER** | Learning Experience Provider；无 Canonical ownership | source grounding、session recovery、learning path | **PILOT / A08** |\n| `learning.opentutor` | [zijinz456/OpenTutor](https://github.com/zijinz456/OpenTutor), `PIN_REQUIRED` | 初判 MIT，需 exact LICENSE 验证 | Web/LLM | **ALGORITHM/UX DONOR** | block/question/adaptive patterns | question variety、difficulty adaptation、cognitive-load usefulness | **EVALUATE / A08** |\n| `parse.raganything` | [HKUDS/RAG-Anything](https://github.com/HKUDS/RAG-Anything), `PIN_REQUIRED` | 初判 MIT，exact pin 验证 | Python + parser/OCR/media deps | **WORKER** | 只产 Transform/Structure；原件和 canonical Source 归 Core | structure retention、table/formula/image、loss、latency | **HIGH / A05** |\n| `retrieval.lightrag` | [HKUDS/LightRAG](https://github.com/HKUDS/LightRAG), `PIN_REQUIRED` | 初判 MIT，exact pin 验证 | Python + embedding/graph | **WORKER / PROJECTION** | Derived index，可删可重建 | Recall@k、nDCG/MRR、citation grounding、rebuild | **HIGH / A06** |\n| `graph.graphiti` | [getzep/graphiti](https://github.com/getzep/graphiti), `PIN_REQUIRED` | Apache-2.0 路线，pin 时验证 | Python + graph backend | **SIDECAR / PROJECTION** | Temporal graph 是投影；事实状态以 Core 为准 | temporal precision、supersession、rebuild | **PILOT / A06** |\n| `memory.memos` | [MemTensor/MemOS](https://github.com/MemTensor/MemOS), `PIN_REQUIRED` | exact LICENSE 必须再核验 | Python/service + model | **SIDECAR** | Agent Experience only；不能提升 Human Knowledge | recall、feedback correction、pollution rate、skill reuse | **PILOT / A07** |\n| `workspace.weknora` | [Tencent/WeKnora](https://github.com/Tencent/WeKnora), `PIN_REQUIRED` | exact LICENSE 再核验 | 独立完整应用栈，较重 | **UX/ALGORITHM DONOR** | 吸收 revision/diff/folder/activity UX，不吸收其 DB authority | revision UX、rollback correctness | **REFERENCE / A12** |\n| `artifact.jupyterlite` | [jupyterlite/jupyterlite](https://github.com/jupyterlite/jupyterlite), `PIN_REQUIRED` | BSD 系许可路线，pin 时验证 | 静态 Web / Pyodide 等 | **DIRECT/ADAPTER RENDERER** | 代码 Lab renderer；执行结果转 Learning Event | notebook launch、exercise、result capture | **HIGH / A09-A10** |\n| `learning.oppia` | [oppia/oppia](https://github.com/oppia/oppia), `PIN_REQUIRED` | Apache-2.0 | 完整平台较重 | **ALGORITHM/UX DONOR** | branching tutor / misconception routing 供体 | branching correctness、hint routing | **REFERENCE / A08** |\n| `parse.docling` | [DS4SD/docling](https://github.com/docling-project/docling), `PIN_REQUIRED` | exact current LICENSE 验证 | Python/models | **WORKER** | document Transform Provider | layout/table/reading-order fidelity | **PILOT / A05** |\n| `ocr.paddleocr` | [PaddlePaddle/PaddleOCR](https://github.com/PaddlePaddle/PaddleOCR), `PIN_REQUIRED` | Apache-2.0 路线 | Python/models | **WORKER** | OCR facts only；不决定 knowledge truth | CER/WER、bbox、tables、VRAM | **HIGH / A05-A11** |\n| `asr.sensevoice` | [FunAudioLLM/SenseVoice](https://github.com/FunAudioLLM/SenseVoice), `PIN_REQUIRED` | 代码/模型分别审计 | model library | **WORKER** | ASR transform only | WER、speed、language robustness | **EVALUATE / A05-A11** |\n\n这里尤其要注意：**Sidecar 不是规避许可证的办法。** 对 GPL/AGPL、模型特殊许可证、商业组件等，进程隔离只是工程边界；许可证义务仍应根据实际复制、修改、分发、网络服务方式判断。\n\n完整 Registry 推荐使用以下 CSV 作为机器初始文件：\n\n```csv\ncapability_id,name,upstream_project,source_pin,license,runtime_req,local_resource,absorption_mode,authority_boundary,data_boundary,benchmark,fallback,status,task_id\ncourse.openmaic,OpenMAIC Course Engine,https://github.com/THU-MAIC/OpenMAIC,PIN_REQUIRED,VERIFY_EXACT,sidecar runtime,runtime:openmaic,ADAPTER+SIDECAR,artifact candidate only,no canonical DB,objective coverage+artifact validity,internal basic planner,PILOT,A10\nartifact.h5p,H5P Renderer,https://github.com/h5p,PIN_REQUIRED,PER_COMPONENT_AUDIT,HTML/JS renderer,runtime:h5p,ADAPTER,renderer only,no canonical DB,package validity+offline render,static renderer,ABSORB,A10\nlearning.learningmap,LearningMAP,https://github.com/ai-for-edu/LearningMAP,PIN_REQUIRED,VERIFY_EXACT,Python+LLM,runtime:learningmap,ADAPTER,KC and pedagogy provider,mastery writes via Core,diagnosis+lesson relevance,internal learning planner,PILOT,A08-A09\ntutor.deeptutor,DeepTutor,https://github.com/HKUDS/DeepTutor,PIN_CURRENT_1_6_X,VERIFY_EXACT,sidecar+LLM,runtime:deeptutor,SIDECAR+ADAPTER,learning experience only,no canonical DB,grounding+recovery+path,internal reader,PILOT,A08\nlearning.opentutor,OpenTutor,https://github.com/zijinz456/OpenTutor,PIN_REQUIRED,VERIFY_EXACT,web+LLM,runtime:opentutor,REFERENCE+ADAPTER,adaptive learning donor,no canonical DB,question types+difficulty,LearningMAP,EVALUATE,A08\nparse.raganything,RAG-Anything,https://github.com/HKUDS/RAG-Anything,PIN_REQUIRED,VERIFY_EXACT,Python+media stack,runtime:raganything,WORKER,transform provider,source canonical in Core,structure fidelity+loss,Docling,HIGH,A05\nretrieval.lightrag,LightRAG,https://github.com/HKUDS/LightRAG,PIN_REQUIRED,VERIFY_EXACT,Python+embedding,runtime:lightrag,WORKER+PROJECTION,retrieval projection,rebuildable only,Recall@nDCG+grounding,FTS5,HIGH,A06\ngraph.graphiti,Graphiti,https://github.com/getzep/graphiti,PIN_REQUIRED,VERIFY_EXACT,Python+graph,runtime:graphiti,SIDECAR+PROJECTION,temporal derived graph,rebuildable only,temporal+supersession precision,Core temporal fields,PILOT,A06\nmemory.memos,MemOS,https://github.com/MemTensor/MemOS,PIN_REQUIRED,VERIFY_EXACT,service+models,runtime:memos,SIDECAR,machine experience only,no human truth promotion,memory recall+pollution+skill reuse,Core receipts,PILOT,A07\nworkspace.weknora,WeKnora,https://github.com/Tencent/WeKnora,PIN_REQUIRED,VERIFY_EXACT,full application,runtime:weknora,REFERENCE,UX donor,no canonical ownership,revision+rollback UX,ArcheAxis native UI,REFERENCE,A12\nartifact.jupyterlite,JupyterLite,https://github.com/jupyterlite/jupyterlite,PIN_REQUIRED,VERIFY_EXACT,static web,runtime:jupyterlite,ADAPTER,lab renderer,no DB access,launch+exercise+event capture,static code renderer,HIGH,A09-A10\nlearning.oppia,Oppia,https://github.com/oppia/oppia,PIN_REQUIRED,Apache-2.0,full web application,runtime:oppia,REFERENCE,branching pedagogy donor,no canonical ownership,misconception+hint routing,internal branching model,REFERENCE,A08\nparse.docling,Docling,https://github.com/docling-project/docling,PIN_REQUIRED,VERIFY_EXACT,Python+models,runtime:docling,WORKER,document transform,no canonical ownership,layout+table+reading order,RAG-Anything,PILOT,A05\nocr.paddleocr,PaddleOCR,https://github.com/PaddlePaddle/PaddleOCR,PIN_REQUIRED,VERIFY_EXACT,Python+models,model:paddleocr,WORKER,OCR facts,no knowledge promotion,CER+layout+bbox,Tesseract,HIGH,A05-A11\nasr.sensevoice,SenseVoice,https://github.com/FunAudioLLM/SenseVoice,PIN_REQUIRED,VERIFY_CODE_AND_WEIGHT_LICENSE,local model,model:sensevoice,WORKER,ASR transform,no knowledge promotion,WER+RTF+memory,faster-whisper,EVALUATE,A05-A11\n```\n\n供应链则不能等发布时才想起来做。Local Green Candidate 自己也必须生成：\n\n```text\nruntime-manifest.json\nsource-identity.json\nplugin-lock.json\nmodel-manifest.json\nsbom.spdx.json 或 cyclonedx.json\nTHIRD_PARTY_NOTICES\nLICENSE inventory\nSHA-256 inventory\nqualification receipt\n```\n\n**这些是 Local Green 资格证据，不意味着发布。**\n\n供应链需要明确分离：\n\n```text\ncode_license\ndependency_license\nmodel_weight_license\ndataset_license\ncontent_license\nAPI/SaaS terms\n```\n\n不能因为 Python 包是 Apache/MIT，就推断它下载的模型权重也是同一许可证。\n\n## 学科课程、知识学习与本地模型\n\nArcheAxis 的最大产品机会不是继续做一个更大的 RAG，而是建立：\n\n> **Knowledge → Learning Design → Course → Artifact → Activity → Assessment → Mastery → Experience**\n\n其中最重要的新抽象是 `DomainLearningPack`。\n\n它不能只是一个 Prompt。它至少应该决定：\n\n```text\n这个领域有哪些知识对象？\n它们的先修关系是什么？\n哪些错误最典型？\n应该怎样教？\n应该用什么活动？\n如何判断掌握？\n用什么工具验证？\n什么 Renderer 最合适？\n需要什么模型？\n哪些知识使用时需要证据？\n```\n\n统一模板：\n\n```yaml\nschema: archeaxis.domain-learning-pack/v1\n\nid: example-domain\ndisplay_name: Example Domain\n\nontology:\n  entity_types: []\n  relation_types: []\n\nknowledge_components:\n  decomposition: []\n  prerequisite_policy: explicit\n  misconception_model: enabled\n\nlearning_objectives:\n  levels:\n    - recognize\n    - explain\n    - apply\n    - analyze\n    - create\n\npedagogy:\n  default:\n    - scaffolding\n    - socratic\n    - retrieval_practice\n  optional: []\n\nlesson_templates: []\nactivity_templates: []\nassessment_types: []\nmastery_rules: {}\n\nrenderers: []\n\nmodel_profile:\n  general_tutor: local:general\n  reasoning: local:reasoning\n  vision: null\n  embedding: local:embedding\n  reranker: local:reranker\n\nevidence_policy:\n  personal_experience_allowed: true\n  external_evidence_required_for_admission: false\n  machine_generated_default: candidate\n  high_risk_real_world_use: current_authoritative_reference_required\n```\n\n四个首批 Pack 建议直接这样落地：\n\n```yaml\nschema: archeaxis.domain-learning-pack/v1\nid: general\ndisplay_name: General Knowledge\n\nontology:\n  entity_types: [concept, fact, procedure, case, person, event, method]\n  relation_types: [depends_on, explains, contrasts_with, example_of, supersedes]\n\nknowledge_components:\n  decomposition: semantic\n  prerequisite_policy: inferred_then_reviewed\n  misconception_model: enabled\n\npedagogy:\n  default: [scaffolding, retrieval_practice, feynman]\n  optional: [socratic, case_based]\n\nlesson_templates:\n  - explain_example_practice\n  - compare_contrast\n  - case_reflection\n\nrenderers:\n  - builtin.lesson\n  - h5p.quiz\n  - openmaic.slides\n  - openmaic.interactive\n\nmodel_profile:\n  general_tutor: local:qwen-small\n  embedding: local:qwen-embedding-small\n  reranker: local:qwen-reranker-small\n\nevidence_policy:\n  personal_experience_allowed: true\n  external_evidence_required_for_admission: false\n  machine_generated_default: candidate\n```\n\n```yaml\nschema: archeaxis.domain-learning-pack/v1\nid: math\ndisplay_name: Mathematics\n\nontology:\n  entity_types: [definition, theorem, lemma, formula, proof, problem, method]\n  relation_types: [prerequisite_of, proves, derives, special_case_of]\n\nknowledge_components:\n  decomposition: fine_grained\n  prerequisite_policy: strict\n  misconception_model: required\n\npedagogy:\n  default: [worked_example, scaffolding, socratic, retrieval_practice]\n  optional: [feynman]\n\nlesson_templates:\n  - concept_derivation_example_practice\n  - proof_reconstruction\n  - error_diagnosis\n\nactivity_templates:\n  - symbolic_problem\n  - graph_interaction\n  - proof_step\n  - simulation\n\nassessment_types:\n  - exact_answer\n  - symbolic_equivalence\n  - step_rubric\n  - proof_rubric\n\nrenderers:\n  - builtin.math\n  - jupyterlite.lab\n  - h5p.quiz\n  - openmaic.simulation\n\nmodel_profile:\n  general_tutor: local:qwen-small\n  reasoning: local:qwen-medium\n  tool_first: [sympy, calculator]\n  embedding: local:qwen-embedding-small\n\nevidence_policy:\n  personal_experience_allowed: true\n  machine_generated_default: candidate\n```\n\n```yaml\nschema: archeaxis.domain-learning-pack/v1\nid: programming\ndisplay_name: Programming\n\nontology:\n  entity_types: [concept, API, syntax, pattern, algorithm, bug, test, project]\n  relation_types: [uses, implements, calls, fails_because, fixes, depends_on]\n\nknowledge_components:\n  decomposition: executable_skill\n  prerequisite_policy: explicit\n  misconception_model: required\n\npedagogy:\n  default: [learn_by_doing, debugging, project_based, code_review]\n  optional: [socratic]\n\nlesson_templates:\n  - explain_run_modify\n  - failing_test_debug\n  - small_project\n  - refactoring_review\n\nactivity_templates:\n  - runnable_code\n  - unit_test\n  - debug_trace\n  - implementation_task\n\nassessment_types:\n  - compile\n  - unit_test\n  - hidden_test\n  - static_analysis\n  - rubric\n\nrenderers:\n  - jupyterlite.lab\n  - builtin.code_lab\n  - h5p.quiz\n\nmodel_profile:\n  coding: local:qwen-small-or-medium\n  rule: model_score_never_replaces_execution\n  embedding: local:qwen-embedding-small\n\nevidence_policy:\n  personal_experience_allowed: true\n  machine_generated_default: candidate\n```\n\n```yaml\nschema: archeaxis.domain-learning-pack/v1\nid: design\ndisplay_name: Visual Design\n\nontology:\n  entity_types: [artifact, layout, typography, color, composition, reference, style, critique]\n  relation_types: [inspired_by, contrasts_with, improves, violates, exemplifies]\n\nknowledge_components:\n  decomposition: principle_and_skill\n  prerequisite_policy: flexible\n  misconception_model: rubric_based\n\npedagogy:\n  default: [example_comparison, critique, project_based, iterative_revision]\n  optional: [feynman, socratic]\n\nlesson_templates:\n  - observe_analyze_redesign\n  - compare_examples\n  - critique_revision\n  - constrained_project\n\nactivity_templates:\n  - image_comparison\n  - hotspot_analysis\n  - moodboard\n  - artifact_critique\n  - redesign_task\n\nassessment_types:\n  - rubric\n  - comparative_review\n  - self_reflection\n  - revision_delta\n\nrenderers:\n  - builtin.visual\n  - h5p.image_hotspot\n  - h5p.image_comparison\n  - openmaic.visual_course\n\nmodel_profile:\n  general_tutor: local:qwen-small\n  vision: local:qwen-vl-small\n  multimodal_embedding: local:qwen-vl-embedding\n  multimodal_reranker: local:qwen-vl-reranker\n\nevidence_policy:\n  personal_experience_allowed: true\n  taste_and_judgment_can_be_personal: true\n  machine_generated_default: candidate\n```\n\n这个体系回答了此前一个非常核心的问题：\n\n> OpenMAIC、H5P、JupyterLite、DeepTutor 到底谁是“课程系统”？\n\n答案是：**都不是 ArcheAxis 的课程权威。**\n\nArcheAxis 自己拥有：\n\n```text\nLearningObjective\nKnowledgeComponent\nCourseManifest\nLearningArtifact\nActivity\nAssessment\nMastery\n```\n\nOpenMAIC/H5P/JupyterLite 等只负责某个阶段。\n\n推荐 Course Manifest：\n\n```text\nKnowledge\n   ↓\nDomain Pack\n   ↓\nLearning Objective\n   ↓\nCourse Planner\n   ↓\nCourse Manifest\n   ├─ Unit\n   │  ├─ Lesson\n   │  ├─ Activity\n   │  └─ Assessment\n   │\n   └─ Artifact Router\n      ├─ OpenMAIC\n      ├─ H5P\n      ├─ JupyterLite\n      ├─ Built-in\n      └─ future renderer\n```\n\n知识准入模型同步调整为：\n\n```text\nKnowledge\n├─ personal_experience\n├─ personal_note\n├─ project_observation\n├─ external_document\n├─ authoritative_reference\n├─ derived_inference\n├─ research_result\n├─ imported_legacy\n└─ machine_candidate\n```\n\n并把以下字段彻底分开：\n\n```text\nsource_type\nowner\nstatus\nsupport_level\nconfidence\nrisk_level\nvalid_from\nvalid_to\nsupersedes\nsuperseded_by\n```\n\n例如：\n\n```yaml\nsource_type: personal_experience\nowner: human\nstatus: accepted\nexternal_evidence: null\nsupport_level: self_reported\nconfidence: high\n```\n\n完全合法。\n\n而：\n\n```yaml\nsource_type: machine_candidate\nowner: machine\nstatus: candidate\nexternal_sources:\n  - source-a\n  - source-b\nconfidence: high\n```\n\n即使有两个来源，也**不能自己变 Accepted**。\n\n同样，`original` 也不能再成为所有 Knowledge 的硬要求：\n\n- 从文件导入的 Source：有原件就保留原件/Hash/Custody；\n- 用户直接输入的个人经验：本身就是原始 Human Statement；\n- Derived inference：保留输入 Knowledge version；\n- Machine candidate：保留 Prompt/Model/Input refs；\n- 不允许为了满足 schema 编造“原件”。\n\n### 本地模型池\n\nRTX 5060 8GB + 64GB RAM + Windows 的核心原则不是追逐最大模型，而是：\n\n> **小模型常驻、岗位分工、工具优先、较大模型按需加载。**\n\n理论上 4-bit 权重的纯参数下限约为 `0.5 byte/parameter`，实际运行还要额外考虑量化元数据、KV cache、视觉 encoder、CUDA buffers 和运行时开销。因此 8GB VRAM 不应该用“14B 4bit≈7GB，所以能跑满显存”这种算法规划产品。\n\n推荐：\n\n| role | 首选模型/能力族 | Quant | Runtime | 8GB 策略 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| `general_tutor` | Qwen 3 系约 4B 档 | Q4_K_M / Q5_K_M | llama.cpp/Ollama-compatible runtime | **默认常驻** |\n| `reasoning` | Qwen 3 系约 8B 档 | Q4_K_M | llama.cpp，必要时 CPU offload | 按需加载、缩短 context |\n| `coding` | 4B/8B 通用或 Code 模型 + 编译器 | Q4 | llama.cpp + real executor | 模型不负责最终正确性 |\n| `vision` | Qwen-VL 约 4B 档 | 4-bit | 独立 Python/VL worker | 与大文本模型避免同时占满 GPU |\n| `embedding` | Qwen3-Embedding 0.6B 档 | FP16/INT8/合适量化 | local worker | 可常驻 |\n| `reranker` | Qwen3-Reranker 0.6B 档 | 轻量 | local worker | 可常驻或 CPU |\n| `multimodal_embedding` | 小型 Qwen-VL Embedding | 低精度 | worker | 设计/图片 Pack 按需 |\n| `multimodal_reranker` | 小型 VL Reranker | 低精度 | worker | 按需 |\n| `ocr` | PaddleOCR + Tesseract | 原生 | worker | 确定性 OCR 优先 |\n| `asr` | SenseVoice / faster-whisper | FP16/INT8 | worker | 不与 VL 同时长期驻 GPU |\n| `math` | 通用 LLM + SymPy/calculator | N/A | tool-first | 计算工具优先 |\n| `programming_eval` | compiler/test/linter | N/A | native sandbox | 不用 LLM 分数替代测试 |\n\n模型资料应继续从官方模型/项目源进行精确 pin，例如 [QwenLM](https://github.com/QwenLM)、[PaddleOCR](https://github.com/PaddlePaddle/PaddleOCR)、[SenseVoice](https://github.com/FunAudioLLM/SenseVoice)。由于本轮最终综合阶段未重新逐个读取 2026-09-19 每个模型仓库的最新模型卡，**最终模型 ID、权重许可证和 GGUF 量化版本必须在 A11 实机 inventory 后锁定，不能把上表中的“模型族建议”写死成已安装事实。**\n\n真正的 Model Profile 应该由本机 benchmark 产生：\n\n```yaml\nrole: general_tutor\nprovider: local\nmodel_resource_id: model:qwen-general-small\nquantization: Q4_K_M\nruntime_resource_id: runtime:llama\nmax_context_qualified: 8192\n\nqualification:\n  cold_start_ms: measured\n  prompt_tokens_per_second: measured\n  generation_tokens_per_second: measured\n  peak_vram_mb: measured\n  peak_ram_mb: measured\n  task_score: measured\n\nfallback:\n  - model:qwen-general-medium-cpu-offload\n```\n\n不允许把厂商 benchmark 冒充本机能力。\n\n## Local Green 与任务路线图\n\nLocal Green 不是“构建一个 ZIP 看起来没问题”。\n\n它应该成为 ArcheAxis 最严格的 Qualification Environment。\n\n最终生命周期：\n\n```mermaid\nflowchart TD\n    M[main exact SHA] --> B[Build in .project-local]\n    B --> C[Local Green Candidate]\n    C --> S[Isolated Candidate Workspace]\n    S --> T[Automated Tests]\n    T --> F[Real First-Use Flow]\n    F --> R1[Close / Restart / Readback]\n    R1 --> MIG[Legacy Copy Migration]\n    MIG --> R2[Restart / Semantic Diff]\n    R2 --> SEC[Security / Plugin / Supply-chain Audit]\n    SEC --> BAK[Backup Existing Green Runtime]\n    BAK --> REP[Replace Runtime Only]\n    REP --> G[Launch Existing Local Green]\n    G --> R3[Same Workspace Readback]\n    R3 --> RB[Rollback Drill]\n    RB --> Q[LOCAL_GREEN_READY_FOR_OWNER_REVIEW]\n```\n\n### Local Green Candidate 替换清单\n\n| 阶段 | 必须完成 | 失败处理 |\n|---|---|---|\n| Source identity | exact commit、tree、dirty=false、build manifest | 停止 |\n| Build | Avalonia、Rust、Workers、built-in plugins | 停止 |\n| Dependency lock | plugin pin、model resource、tool resource | 停止 |\n| SBOM | code/dependency/model license inventory | 有未知许可证则阻塞相关插件 |\n| Automated | unit/integration/boundary/contract | 停止 |\n| Test corpus | 仅使用 `D:\\All projects\\ceshi` | 不碰真实资料库 |\n| First-use | UI 完成 import→read→knowledge→learning | 停止 |\n| First learning | 空库可生成真实第一 LearningArtifact | 停止 |\n| Human review | 用户实际回答，不写 synthetic correct | 停止 |\n| Machine task | 使用同一 knowledge 完成真实机器任务 | 停止 |\n| Failure | 至少一条真实失败→correction→retest | 停止 |\n| Restart | 关闭全部进程，重新启动后同库读取 | 停止 |\n| Migration | Legacy DB **copy** → staging；semantic diff | 不激活 |\n| Backup | Hash-addressed backup 当前 Green runtime | 无备份则不得替换 |\n| Runtime replace | 只替换 Runtime，不删除用户 data/material | 失败立即 rollback |\n| Production-local boot | 从真实 Green 启动入口启动 | 失败 rollback |\n| Readback | 原 workspace、learning、knowledge、receipts | 差异则 rollback |\n| Rollback drill | 恢复旧 runtime 并验证 | 失败则 Candidate 不合格 |\n| Final state | `LOCAL_GREEN_READY_FOR_OWNER_REVIEW` | **不得 Release** |\n\nLocal Green 的身份建议：\n\n```json\n{\n  \"distribution\": \"local-green\",\n  \"historical_public_release_base\": \"v0.6.14\",\n  \"source_commit\": \"<exact-sha>\",\n  \"source_tree\": \"<tree-sha>\",\n  \"runtime_manifest_digest\": \"<sha256>\",\n  \"published\": false,\n  \"release_authorized\": false\n}\n```\n\n这个字段中的 `v0.6.14` 只是 provenance，不表示当前 GitHub `main` 是 v0.6.14。\n\n### 最终任务包\n\n建议正式 Plan ID：\n\n```text\nAAK-R6-LOCAL-GREEN-ABSORB-FIRST-CONVERGENCE\n```\n\n任务图：\n\n| Task | 目标 | Priority | Owner Role | Gate |\n|---|---|---:|---|---|\n| `A00 Authority Convergence` | R6 唯一活动 SSOT；历史 supersession；修 digest/architecture/state | P0 | Engineer + QA | G0 |\n| `A01 No-Release & CI Convergence` | 冻结 Release；统一 GitHub Contract/ruleset；Local Green gate | P0 | Engineer + Owner | G1 |\n| `A02 Resource Authority` | 共享模型/工具/路径 resolver，禁止 PATH guessing | P0 | Engineer | G2 |\n| `A03 Capability Registry & Plugin SDK` | Registry、manifest、permissions、discovery、receipts | P0 | Integrator | G3 |\n| `A04 Knowledge/Source V3` | personal/external/machine + temporal/support/risk | P0 | Engineer | G4 |\n| `A05 Multiformat Pipeline` | RAG-Anything/Docling/OCR/ASR 等 | P1 | Integrator | G5 |\n| `A06 Retrieval/Graph/Research` | FTS+Embedding+Rerank+LightRAG+Graphiti | P1 | Integrator | G5 |\n| `A07 Machine Experience` | MemOS 或等价 capability；Lesson/Skill candidate | P1 | Integrator | G6 |\n| `A08 Human Learning Kernel` | FSRS + diagnostic + adaptive + teach-back | P0 | Engineer | G6 |\n| `A09 Domain Learning Packs` | General/Math/Programming/Design | P0 | Integrator | G7 |\n| `A10 Courseware Mesh` | OpenMAIC/H5P/JupyterLite/renderer router | P0 | Integrator | G7 |\n| `A11 Local Model Pool` | 实机 inventory/benchmark/router | P1 | Integrator + QA | G8 |\n| `A12 Avalonia Workspace` | 正式 surfaces + 插件 UX + 真实 Core | P0 | Engineer | G8 |\n| `A13 Migration & Local Green` | nonempty legacy copy、diff、backup、replace、rollback | P0 | Engineer + QA | G9 |\n| `A14 Human↔Machine Full Loop` | 真正的双向学习纵切 | P0 | QA + Integrator | G10 |\n| `A15 Independent Audit` | Authority/Security/Data/UX/Supply chain independent check | P0 | QA | G11 |\n| `A16 Owner Gate` | 仅 Owner 做最终判断 | P0 | Owner | G12 |\n\nGate 定义：\n\n```text\nG0  Single Authority\nG1  Release Freeze + CI/Ruleset Consistency\nG2  Environment/Path/Resource Determinism\nG3  Plugin Security & Registry\nG4  Knowledge V3\nG5  Source/Parse/Retrieval Reality\nG6  Human/Machine Learning State\nG7  Domain-aware Courseware\nG8  Local Model + Avalonia First Use\nG9  Migration + Restart + Rollback\nG10 Full Real Closed Loop\nG11 Independent Audit\nG12 Owner Review\n```\n\n**G12 通过也不自动发布。** 它只允许 Owner 决定是否另建未来 Release TaskPack。\n\n### 短期、中期、长期路线\n\n以 2026 年 9 月 19 日为基准：\n\n| 时间窗 | 必须完成 | 角色 |\n|---|---|---|\n| **至 2026-10-19，约 30 天** | A00-A04；Release Freeze；live ruleset 重核；Capability Registry；Plugin Contract；Knowledge V3；共享资源权威；Avalonia route 骨架 | Owner / Engineer / Integrator / QA |\n| **至 2026-12-18，约 90 天** | A05-A12 主干；核心格式增强；LightRAG/Graphiti pilot；OpenMAIC/H5P/JupyterLite；4 个 Domain Pack；DeepTutor/LearningMAP 适配；Local Model benchmark；Avalonia first-use | Engineer / Integrator / QA |\n| **至 2027-03-18，约 180 天** | A07/A13/A14/A15；Machine experience；真实 legacy copy migration；Human↔Machine closed loop；完整 restart/readback/rollback；Local Green replacement eligibility | Owner / Engineer / Integrator / QA |\n\n30 天内**不建议**做的事情包括：\n\n- 再造新 RAG；\n- 自己从零写互动课件播放器；\n- 自己从零写 Notebook；\n- 再创建一套 Memory DB；\n- 扩充大量 UI 页面但没有真实 Core；\n- 修新 Release installer；\n- 花时间决定“v0.7 叫什么”。\n\n90 天的衡量标准也不是“接了多少 GitHub 项目”，而应该是：\n\n```text\n多少 Capability 真正通过 Contract 接入\n+\n多少可以卸载/替换\n+\n多少用户链真正跑通\n```\n\n真正的 R6 Golden Journey 建议固定为：\n\n```text\n真实测试资料\n→ Import\n→ Parse\n→ Reader\n→ Anchor\n→ Human Knowledge\n→ Personal Experience 补充\n→ Knowledge Component\n→ Domain Pack\n→ Course Manifest\n→ Learning Artifact\n→ 真人完成 Activity\n→ Assessment\n→ Mastery\n→ Restart\n→ Review\n→ Machine Task\n→ Failure\n→ Correction\n→ Agent Experience\n→ Lesson/Skill Candidate\n→ Human Review\n→ Retest\n→ Restart\n→ Full Readback\n```\n\n任何 `PASS` 如果绕过其中对应步骤，都不得冒充 Full Loop。\n\n## 风险、Owner Gate 与研究限制\n\n最主要风险已经不是“代码写不出来”，而是**吸收太多成熟项目后再次形成新的架构混乱**。因此 R6 必须用边界治理来换取开放性。\n\n| 风险 | 典型后果 | 缓解 |\n|---|---|---|\n| 多个 Canonical Store | WeKnora/MemOS/LightRAG/DeepTutor 各有一份“真相” | 只有 Rust SQLite canonical；其他全可重建 |\n| Plugin 任意代码执行 | 读取用户文件、token、DB | 默认进程隔离；scoped token；无 raw SQLite |\n| 网络泄露 | Local knowledge 被第三方 provider 获取 | 默认 deny egress；按 capability 显式授权 |\n| 供应链 | 上游被替换/恶意更新 | exact commit/release pin + hash + SBOM |\n| License contagion/违规 | 分发义务、源代码义务 | 每 capability 独立 license review；Sidecar 不视为规避许可证 |\n| 模型许可证 | code 开源但 weights 限制不同 | code/model license 分栏 |\n| Prompt injection | 文件内容诱导 Worker 越权 | content 永远是 data，不是 authority；工具权限由 Core 控制 |\n| Personal experience 无证据 | 被误当外部客观事实 | source_type + owner + support_level 清晰显示 |\n| Machine hallucination | 自动污染 Knowledge | machine 默认 candidate，不得自升 Accepted |\n| Temporal knowledge | 旧经验覆盖新事实或反之 | valid_from/to + supersedes + temporal projection |\n| High-risk domain | 医疗/法律等错误现实决策 | 可存储无证据经验，但现实决策输出强制 current authoritative reference + human review |\n| 8GB VRAM | 模型堆叠导致 OOM/卡顿 | role router、小模型常驻、按需加载、CPU offload |\n| Course generation 幻觉 | 课件看起来漂亮但教学错误 | CourseManifest → Knowledge refs → assessment validation → human edit |\n| Migration | 新系统破坏真实 Green | 只读 snapshot/copy/staging/diff/activation/rollback |\n| CI 假安全 | CI PASS 但用户本机坏 | Local Green qualification 是更高层 Gate |\n| 版本重新漂移 | 又开始为了修复不停发版 | Owner-only Release authorization |\n\n对于 Evidence，最终策略应形成一句简单且稳定的产品原则：\n\n> **ArcheAxis 保存“谁认为了什么、依据是什么、什么时候有效”，而不是只保存“有证据才允许存在的知识”。**\n\n因此：\n\n```text\n无证据\n≠\n无知识价值\n\n有证据\n≠\n自动正确\n\nAI 有引用\n≠\n可自行 Accepted\n\n用户个人经验\n≠\n必须找论文证明\n```\n\n而对于医疗、法律、财务、安全标准这类高风险场景：\n\n```text\nPersonal Knowledge 可以保存\n        ↓\n用于现实高风险判断\n        ↓\n必须追加当前、权威、适用辖区/时间的依据\n        ↓\nHuman Review\n```\n\n这兼容了个人知识库与专业风险控制，而不是二选一。\n\nOwner 最终应只审核以下事项：\n\n1. **ArcheAxis 是否仍只有一个 Canonical Truth。**\n2. **个人经验是否真的能自然进入，而没有被 Evidence 卡死。**\n3. **AI 是否依然不能自我提升为 Accepted Knowledge。**\n4. **不同领域是否真的表现出不同课程/学习形态，而不是换 Prompt。**\n5. **OpenMAIC/H5P/DeepTutor 等是否成为可替换能力，而不是新的产品主权。**\n6. **所有外部模型和工具是否继续通过共享 Resource Authority 使用，没有重复下载和私自扫描。**\n7. **Avalonia 是否可以从零完成完整用户 Journey。**\n8. **Legacy 数据是否通过真实非空 copy 完成迁移和语义 diff。**\n9. **Local Green 新 runtime 是否经过真实 restart/readback/rollback。**\n10. **有没有任何代码、CI 或自动化绕过 Owner 创建新 Release。**\n\n最终唯一允许的自动化结论是：\n\n```text\nLOCAL_GREEN_READY_FOR_OWNER_REVIEW\n```\n\n不能写：\n\n```text\nRELEASE_READY\n```\n\n更不能自动创建 Release。\n\n可直接作为新的 PR / TaskPack 顶部说明：\n\n```text\nPlan:\nAAK-R6-LOCAL-GREEN-ABSORB-FIRST-CONVERGENCE\n\nMission:\nConverge ArcheAxis into a local-first canonical knowledge,\nhuman-learning and machine-learning system by absorbing mature\ncapabilities behind replaceable contracts rather than rebuilding\nmature upstream functionality.\n\nAuthority:\n1. Current Owner decisions dated 2026-09-19.\n2. R6 active authority.\n3. Current code/contracts/live repository configuration.\n4. R5 evidence and historical audits.\n5. Older plans as historical input only.\n\nHard constraints:\n- NO new product release.\n- NO new Git tag.\n- NO GitHub Release.\n- NO product-version progression on main.\n- Historical v0.6.14 remains immutable provenance.\n- Local Green is the qualification target.\n- A qualified new Local Green may replace the existing local runtime.\n- Release requires separate explicit Owner authorization.\n- Canonical SQLite has one Rust-controlled write boundary.\n- Avalonia, Python workers and third-party plugins never write it directly.\n- Personal experience may be accepted without external evidence.\n- Machine-generated knowledge remains Candidate until authorized review.\n- Mature upstream capability must be evaluated before self-build.\n- One default implementation per capability.\n- Sidecars/projections/memory/indexes never become canonical truth.\n- Final qualification requires real first-use, restart, readback,\n  nonempty migration, failure/retest and rollback.\n- Synthetic PASS is forbidden.\n\nFinal automated status:\nLOCAL_GREEN_READY_FOR_OWNER_REVIEW\n```\n\n本报告仍有三项需要在 **A00/A03/A11 的第一轮机器执行**中补成可审计附件：当前 HEAD `0e934f3...` 下的完整远端 branch snapshot、GitHub live ruleset/workflow snapshot，以及每个外部供体截至实际吸收日的 exact commit/license/model-weight pin。本轮最终综合阶段没有继续进行这些最后的在线读取，因此这里明确标为 **待 pin 的实施证据**，而没有用旧快照或猜测冒充当前事实。\n\n这不会改变整体路线：**ArcheAxis 现在最成熟的终局不是继续扩张一个巨型单体，而是把 Rust Canonical Kernel 做小而牢，把成熟开源能力做成可替换 Capability Mesh，再用 Domain Learning Pack 把“知识”真正变成因人、因学科、因任务而不同的课程与学习体验；最后全部在现有 Local Green 上跑通，停在 Owner Gate，绝不自行发布。**"]},"status":"finished_successfully","end_turn":true,"weight":1.0,"metadata":{"finish_details":{"type":"stop","stop_tokens":[200002]},"is_complete":true,"citations":[],"content_references":[],"story_events":[],"resolved_model_slug":"gpt-5-thinking","gizmo_id":"g-p-6aa0fe49c4188191a5c9e2109ffe59ed","cot_version":"v5","venus_message":true,"venus_plan":{"plan_id":"plan-2026-09-19T22:30:00Z-aak-absorb","version":3,"title":"ArcheAxis 本地 Green 吸收研究计划","steps":[{"id":"step-1","text":"收集并归档项目所有历史提交、审计与任务包文档。","status":"completed","reason":"已在对话中开始并确认：Assistant 已按当前 GitHub 云端 main 做了全量审计并开始归档历史提交与审计证据（对话中多次引用具体提交与审计结论）。"},{"id":"step-2","text":"梳理并对照 9/14、9/15、9/18、9/19 的权威审计与变更记录。","status":"completed","reason":"已在对话中复核并对照了 9/14、9/15、9/18、9/19 的审计与提交，列出关键发现与后续优先级（对话中多处引用 9/14–9/19 的审计结论）。"},{"id":"step-3","text":"调研并评估 OpenMAIC、LearningMAP、DeepTutor、H5P 等供体项目。","status":"completed","reason":"已在对话中列出并评估了 OpenMAIC、LearningMAP、DeepTutor、H5P 等供体项目的吸收价值与边界，并在最终方案中纳入吸收优先级。"},{"id":"step-4","text":"盘点本地模型与工具并制定插件化吸收与适配策略。","status":"completed","reason":"已在对话中盘点本地模型与工具（RTX5060 8GB/64GB RAM/Win）并给出岗位化模型池与量化策略建议。"},{"id":"step-5","text":"生成最终吸收优先级清单与本地 Green 替换验收步骤。","status":"in_progress","reason":"正在生成并交付最终成熟方案报告（包含执行摘要、三栏对照、Capability Registry 初版、Domain Pack 模板、插件化架构、Local Green lifecycle、模型池、30/90/180 路线图等）。"}]},"venus_widget_state":{"plan":{"plan_id":"plan-2026-09-19T22:30:00Z-aak-absorb","version":3,"title":"ArcheAxis 本地 Green 吸收研究计划","steps":[{"id":"step-1","text":"收集并归档项目所有历史提交、审计与任务包文档。","status":"completed","reason":"已在对话中开始并确认：Assistant 已按当前 GitHub 云端 main 做了全量审计并开始归档历史提交与审计证据（对话中多次引用具体提交与审计结论）。"},{"id":"step-2","text":"梳理并对照 9/14、9/15、9/18、9/19 的权威审计与变更记录。","status":"completed","reason":"已在对话中复核并对照了 9/14、9/15、9/18、9/19 的审计与提交，列出关键发现与后续优先级（对话中多处引用 9/14–9/19 的审计结论）。"},{"id":"step-3","text":"调研并评估 OpenMAIC、LearningMAP、DeepTutor、H5P 等供体项目。","status":"completed","reason":"已在对话中列出并评估了 OpenMAIC、LearningMAP、DeepTutor、H5P 等供体项目的吸收价值与边界，并在最终方案中纳入吸收优先级。"},{"id":"step-4","text":"盘点本地模型与工具并制定插件化吸收与适配策略。","status":"completed","reason":"已在对话中盘点本地模型与工具（RTX5060 8GB/64GB RAM/Win）并给出岗位化模型池与量化策略建议。"},{"id":"step-5","text":"生成最终吸收优先级清单与本地 Green 替换验收步骤。","status":"in_progress","reason":"正在生成并交付最终成熟方案报告（包含执行摘要、三栏对照、Capability Registry 初版、Domain Pack 模板、插件化架构、Local Green lifecycle、模型池、30/90/180 路线图等）。"}]},"step_statuses_by_plan":{"plan-2026-09-19T22:30:00Z-aak-absorb":{"step-1":"completed","step-2":"completed","step-3":"completed","step-4":"completed","step-5":"in_progress"}},"waiting_for_user_response_on_plan_until":null,"status":"researching","last_updated_at":"2026-09-19T15:59:54.160810Z"}},"recipient":"all","channel":"final"}},"activity_messages":[{"id":"280b0fd4-c6c3-4941-a22b-91885fa43721","author":{"role":"assistant","name":null,"metadata":{}},"create_time":1789821629.28487,"update_time":1789821631.540595,"content":{"content_type":"reasoning_recap","content":"已停止思考"},"status":"finished_successfully","end_turn":true,"weight":1.0,"metadata":{"reasoning_status":"reasoning_cancelled"},"recipient":"all","channel":null},{"id":"fbfe5305-f1af-4201-a5f0-eccbaacd9142","author":{"role":"assistant","name":null,"metadata":{}},"create_time":1789833194.149038,"update_time":null,"content":{"content_type":"thoughts","thoughts":[{"summary":"Planning research across available sources","content":"I’m preparing to research the repository, historical records, and relevant online sources so I can reconstruct the user’s history accurately. I’m checking which connected sources are available and distinguishing current code from older material. Since some monitoring capabilities aren’t explicitly requested here, I’m focusing on the history and source review instead.","chunks":[],"finished":true},{"summary":"Planned research across available sources","content":"","chunks":[],"finished":true}],"source_analysis_msg_id":"f63b7acb-4cc6-4900-b7a9-8446a87e6884"},"status":"finished_successfully","end_turn":false,"weight":1.0,"metadata":{"reasoning_status":"is_reasoning"},"recipient":"all","channel":null},{"id":"b6ab064a-c083-4806-b65d-ab2ed31a29e2","author":{"role":"tool","name":"GitHub.fetch_commit","metadata":{}},"create_time":1789833201.065419,"update_time":null,"content":{"content_type":"text","parts":[]},"status":"finished_successfully","end_turn":null,"weight":1.0,"metadata":{"invoked_resource":{"resource_uri":"/connector_76869538009648d5b282a4bb21c3d157/link_6a2aaf39b9948191b8aafcdc287530c7/fetch_commit"},"citation_metadata":[{"url":"https://github.com/DTALEX66/ArcheAxis-Knowledge-OS/commit/0e934f33ee9a5f6082c04abda454c67df1055097","title":"fix(r6): resolve portable worker roots"}],"retrieval_citations_metadata":[{"url":"https://github.com/DTALEX66/ArcheAxis-Knowledge-OS/commit/0e934f33ee9a5f6082c04abda454c67df1055097","title":"fix(r6): resolve portable worker roots"}]},"recipient":"all","channel":"commentary"},{"id":"9ae5d7fe-72ef-459a-a01f-11754e108153","author":{"role":"tool","name":"GitHub.fetch","metadata":{}},"create_time":1789833208.0006049,"update_time":null,"content":{"content_type":"text","parts":[]},"status":"finished_successfully","end_turn":null,"weight":1.0,"metadata":{"reasoning_title":"Searching Repository Tree for Exact Taskpack Filenames","invoked_resource":{"resource_uri":"/connector_76869538009648d5b282a4bb21c3d157/link_6a2aaf39b9948191b8aafcdc287530c7/fetch"},"citation_metadata":[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTALEX66/ArcheAxis-Knowledge-OS/git/trees/0e934f33ee9a5f6082c04abda454c67df1055097?recursive=1","title":"0e934f33ee9a5f6082c04abda454c67df1055097"}],"retrieval_citations_metadata":[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTALEX66/ArcheAxis-Knowledge-OS/git/trees/0e934f33ee9a5f6082c04abda454c67df1055097?recursive=1","title":"0e934f33ee9a5f6082c04abda454c67df1055097"}]},"recipient":"all","channel":"commentary"},{"id":"39feb1ca-c6ff-403f-84f6-e13256f105d9","author":{"role":"assistant","name":null,"metadata":{}},"create_time":1789833264.538192,"update_time":null,"content":{"content_type":"thoughts","thoughts":[{"summary":"Structuring a current-state research plan","content":"I’m treating the current repository state as authoritative rather than relying on older assumptions. I’m checking the latest files, architecture, workflows, migration boundaries, release evidence, and historical changes. I’m also verifying upstream projects, licenses, local model options, and deployment constraints before proposing a capability registry, domain packs, plugin architecture, rollback process, and staged roadmap.","chunks":[],"finished":true},{"summary":"Structured a current-state research plan","content":"","chunks":[],"finished":true}],"source_analysis_msg_id":"cdee737a-cb91-4715-8f1e-75739fcd2245"},"status":"finished_successfully","end_turn":false,"weight":1.0,"metadata":{"reasoning_status":"is_reasoning"},"recipient":"all","channel":null},{"id":"93d800c8-b4ec-4aa4-8541-d5c66550a8a9","author":{"role":"assistant","name":null,"metadata":{}},"create_time":1789833588.298729,"update_time":null,"content":{"content_type":"reasoning_recap","content":"Worked for 6m 43s"},"status":"finished_successfully","end_turn":false,"weight":1.0,"metadata":{"reasoning_status":"reasoning_ended"},"recipient":"all","channel":null},{"id":"150676a2-7b00-5b60-97e8-d22af0d5bd98","author":{"role":"assistant","name":null,"metadata":{}},"create_time":null,"update_time":null,"content":{"content_type":"reasoning_recap","content":""},"status":"finished_successfully","end_turn":false,"weight":0.0,"metadata":{"reasoning_title":"Generated report on ArcheAxis Knowledge OS 最终成熟方案：历史权威重构、Absorb-First 能力融合与 Local Green 收敛"},"recipient":"all","channel":null}],"source_searches":[{"key":"https://github.com/DTALEX66/ArcheAxis-Knowledge-OS/commit/0e934f33ee9a5f6082c04abda454c67df1055097","domain":"github.com","url":"https://github.com/DTALEX66/ArcheAxis-Knowledge-OS/commit/0e934f33ee9a5f6082c04abda454c67df1055097","titles":[{"key":"https://github.com/DTALEX66/ArcheAxis-Knowledge-OS/commit/0e934f33ee9a5f6082c04abda454c67df1055097-fix(r6): resolve portable worker roots","title":"fix(r6): resolve portable worker roots","items":[{"url":"https://github.com/DTALEX66/ArcheAxis-Knowledge-OS/commit/0e934f33ee9a5f6082c04abda454c67df1055097","domain":"github.com","title":"fix(r6): resolve portable worker roots","cloud_doc_url":"https://github.com/DTALEX66/ArcheAxis-Knowledge-OS/commit/0e934f33ee9a5f6082c04abda454c67df1055097"}]}]},{"key":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTALEX66/ArcheAxis-Knowledge-OS/git/trees/0e934f33ee9a5f6082c04abda454c67df1055097?recursive=1","domain":"api.github.com","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTALEX66/ArcheAxis-Knowledge-OS/git/trees/0e934f33ee9a5f6082c04abda454c67df1055097?recursive=1","titles":[{"key":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTALEX66/ArcheAxis-Knowledge-OS/git/trees/0e934f33ee9a5f6082c04abda454c67df1055097?recursive=1-0e934f33ee9a5f6082c04abda454c67df1055097","title":"0e934f33ee9a5f6082c04abda454c67df1055097","items":[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTALEX66/ArcheAxis-Knowledge-OS/git/trees/0e934f33ee9a5f6082c04abda454c67df1055097?recursive=1","domain":"api.github.com","title":"0e934f33ee9a5f6082c04abda454c67df1055097","cloud_doc_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTALEX66/ArcheAxis-Knowledge-OS/git/trees/0e934f33ee9a5f6082c04abda454c67df1055097?recursive=1"}]}]}]}